    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/f990baa85445bf60167e569e79ab38d1.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eastwind Adventures Chapter 1 </strong> is a storytelling and adventure game for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/8063bebc0896f2321d4849f19ff90c76.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things are stirring in the lands of Eastwind. Great powers are awakening, some good, some evil, and all are drawn towards the mysterious islands in the east. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The strange, enchanted mists that covered these islands and kept them hidden, are withdrawing, and what is unveiled, will change the future of Eastwind forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a young adventurer on a path to greatness, as a young sorceress who is just beginning to discover her power, and as an evil wizard with the ambition to become the most evil wizard in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first chapter of the Eastwind saga.  More are to come, and we will be looking to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">expand and improve the game with updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/68c81d0e687844351ec552616a0a1541.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Chose your hero and fight the good fight in exciting battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Play out different stories with different protagonists. Some fighting for good, some for evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Explore the lands of Eastwind, and venture towards the enchanted islands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 that have been unveiled. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Forge a path to greatness, in wizardry or knighthood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/ea9b6df5ceb3620db6f25813bdfc5d8a.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Join us on our quest, and we will have great adventures together!'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/f990baa85445bf60167e569e79ab38d1.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eastwind Adventures Chapter 1 </strong> is a storytelling and adventure game for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/8063bebc0896f2321d4849f19ff90c76.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things are stirring in the lands of Eastwind. Great powers are awakening, some good, some evil, and all are drawn towards the mysterious islands in the east. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The strange, enchanted mists that covered these islands and kept them hidden, are withdrawing, and what is unveiled, will change the future of Eastwind forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a young adventurer on a path to greatness, as a young sorceress who is just beginning to discover her power, and as an evil wizard with the ambition to become the most evil wizard in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first chapter of the Eastwind saga.  More are to come, and we will be looking to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">expand and improve the game with updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/68c81d0e687844351ec552616a0a1541.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Chose your hero and fight the good fight in exciting battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Play out different stories with different protagonists. Some fighting for good, some for evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*  Explore the lands of Eastwind, and venture towards the enchanted islands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 that have been unveiled. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Forge a path to greatness, in wizardry or knighthood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656870/extras/ea9b6df5ceb3620db6f25813bdfc5d8a.avif?t=1741168318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Join us on our quest, and we will have great adventures together!'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
